{"suttaId":"tha-ap118","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[5537,5561],"vripara":"49"},"segments":{"tha-ap118:0.3":"Citakapūjakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap118:1.1":"“Vasāmi rājāyatane, sāmacco saparijjano;","tha-ap118:1.3":"Parinibbute bhagavati, sikhino lokabandhuno.","tha-ap118:2.1":"“Pasannacitto sumano, citakaṃ agamāsahaṃ;","tha-ap118:2.3":"Tūriyaṃ tattha vādetvā, gandhamālaṃ samokiriṃ.","tha-ap118:3.1":"“Citamhi pūjaṃ katvāna, vanditvā citakaṃ ahaṃ;","tha-ap118:3.3":"Pasannacitto sumano, sakaṃ bhavanupāgamiṃ.","tha-ap118:4.1":"“Bhavane upaviṭṭhohaṃ, citapūjaṃ anussariṃ;","tha-ap118:4.3":"Tena kammena dvipadinda, lokajeṭṭha narāsabha.","tha-ap118:5.1":"“Anubhotvāna sampattiṃ, devesu mānusesu ca;","tha-ap118:5.3":"Pattomhi acalaṃ ṭhānaṃ, hitvā jayaparājayaṃ.","tha-ap118:6.1":"“Ekattiṃse ito kappe, yaṃ pupphamabhiropayiṃ;","tha-ap118:6.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, citapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap118:7.1":"“Ekūnatiṃsakappamhi, ito soḷasa rājāno;","tha-ap118:7.3":"Uggatā nāma nāmena, cakkavattī mahabbalā.","tha-ap118:8.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap118:9.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā citakapūjako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap118:10.1":"Citakapūjakattherassāpadānaṃ chaṭṭhaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":2869,"to":2870,"paras":[{"para":2869,"vripara":"49","refs":["tha-ap118:1"],"words":["vasāmi rājāyatane","rājāyatane","parinibbute bhagavatī"],"lines":["So aparabhāge attano pubbakammaṃ saritvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>vasāmi rājāyatane</b>tiādimāha.","<b>Rājāyatane</b>ti devarājūnaṃ āyatanaṃ rājāyatanaṃ, tassa rukkhassa nāmadheyyo vā.","<b>Parinibbute bhagavatī</b>ti parisamantato kiñci anavasesetvā khandhaparinibbānakāle parinibbānasamaye parinibbānappattassa sikhino lokabandhunoti sambandho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap118:1"],["tha-ap118:1"],["tha-ap118:1"]]},{"para":2870,"vripara":"50","refs":["tha-ap118:2"],"words":["citakaṃ agamāsahaṃ","tūriyaṃ tattha vādetvā"],"lines":["<b>Citakaṃ agamāsahan</b>ti candanāgarudevadārukappūratakkolādisugandhadārūhi citaṃ rāsigatanti citaṃ, citameva citakaṃ, buddhagāravena citakaṃ pūjanatthāya citakassa samīpaṃ ahaṃ agamāsinti attho.","Tattha gantvā katakiccaṃ dassento <b>tūriyaṃ tattha vādetvā</b>tiādimāha.","Taṃ sabbaṃ suviññeyyamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap118:2"],["tha-ap118:2"],["tha-ap118:2"]]}]},"tika":null}
